  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5448,
      "text": "Say, “It has been revealed to me that a group of jinn listened [to the Qur’an,] and they said, ‘Indeed, we have heard a wondrous recitation",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5449,
      "text": "that guides to the right way, so we have believed in it, and we will never associate anyone with our Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5450,
      "text": "And that He – our exalted and glorified Lord[1] – has neither taken a wife nor a child;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5451,
      "text": "and that the fool among us [i.e., Satan] used to say outrageous things about Allah[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5452,
      "text": "although we thought that humans and jinn would never tell lies about Allah.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5453,
      "text": "And there were some men who used to seek refuge with some jinn, but they only increased them in burden.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5454,
      "text": "They thought, just like you [jinn] thought that Allah would never send any messenger.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5455,
      "text": "We have sought to reach heaven but found it filled with stern guards and flaming fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5456,
      "text": "We used to take up positions there for eavesdropping, but now anyone who eavesdrops will find a flaming fire waiting for him[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5457,
      "text": "We do not know whether evil is intended for those on earth, or their Lord intends good for them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5458,
      "text": "Among us are some who are righteous and some who are otherwise, for we follow divergent ways[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5459,
      "text": "We have realized that we can never escape Allah on earth, nor can we ever escape Him by fleeing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 572,
      "ruku": 506,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5460,
      "text": "When we heard the guidance [of the Qur’an], we believed in it. Whoever believes in his Lord will have no fear of curtailment [from his reward] or injustice[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 72,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجِنِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jinn",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Jinn",
        "numberOfAyahs": 28,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
